{
  "quest.5C0E110A7E110010.title": "The Tear",
  "quest.5C0E110A7E110010.quest_subtitle": "What the Echo is",
  "quest.5C0E110A7E110010.quest_desc": [
    "Every center-block break is a page in the &6Randon Atlas&r. The dedication win is separate.",
    "",
    "At &e100,000&r team &eRandon Mined&r, the next center block is &dThe Echo&r (&fkubejs:echo_block&r). It is not in the random pool. It happens once per island team.",
    "",
    "Online teammates receive an &dEcho Seal&r. Mine The Echo to pick the block up and place it on the island.",
    "",
    "&6The Randon Ending&r needs both the &eAtlas Seal&r (finish the active Atlas set) and the Echo. Either order is fine.",
    "",
    "&c50,000 and 100,000 cannot be checked off by hand.&r They follow the team counter."
  ],
  "task.5C0E110A7E110011.title": "Read about The Echo",

  "quest.5C0E110A7E110020.title": "Echo Approaches",
  "quest.5C0E110A7E110020.quest_subtitle": "50,000 Randon Mined",
  "quest.5C0E110A7E110020.quest_desc": [
    "Reach &e50,000&r team Randon Mined.",
    "",
    "The void is listening. The Echo is still &e50,000&r breaks away.",
    "",
    "Completes automatically from the counter. Check progress with &f/randomblock milestones&r."
